{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through dreamy brutalist architecture with only one mission, reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with only a shotgun and a dream; sprint, slide, and leap through levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new paths and optimize your route to achieve the fastest possible times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize strange shells to warp gravity, shift momentum, and bridge through solid surfaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 3 different worlds with 5 levels each.\u00a0Play through levels to unlock new modes. Each of the modes changes the goal in a specific way:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DREAM - The standard level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEQUENCE - Pass through gates in order to open the goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CIRCUIT - Destroy all targets to unlock the end of the level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RETROVERSION - Play though the level in reverse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AXIS - Start the level with one magazine of shells and all other shells are removed from the map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each level, you will earn a medal based on your completion time. Achieving the highest possible medal tier, DREAM, will require maximized momentum, efficient route planning, and optimal usage of available resources. GOOD LUCK.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810190?t=1763138863","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810190?t=1763138863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810190/5cd4889898e7d64e77da59e34d5156abfbc2e3af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763138863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810190/5cd4889898e7d64e77da59e34d5156abfbc2e3af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763138863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through dreamy brutalist architecture with only one mission, reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with only a shotgun and a dream; sprint, slide, and leap through levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new paths and optimize your route to achieve the fastest possible times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize strange shells to warp gravity, shift momentum, and bridge through solid surfaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 3 different worlds with 5 levels each.\u00a0Play through levels to unlock new modes. Each of the modes changes the goal in a specific way:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DREAM - The standard level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEQUENCE - Pass through gates in order to open the goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CIRCUIT - Destroy all targets to unlock the end of the level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RETROVERSION - Play though the level in reverse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AXIS - Start the level with one magazine of shells and all other shells are removed from the map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each level, you will earn a medal based on your completion time. Achieving the highest possible medal tier, DREAM, will require maximized momentum, efficient route planning, and optimal usage of available resources. GOOD LUCK.</p>","developers":["Tarkensplat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810190/a0ee60331317e435